## File Structure (Complete)

```
poml-go-sdk/
│
├── vscode-extension/              # NEW: VS Code Extension
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── extension.ts           # Entry point (activation, commands)
│   │   ├── manager.ts             # Binary detection + lifecycle
│   │   ├── server.ts              # MCP server adapter
│   │   ├── http-client.ts         # HTTP client wrapper
│   │   ├── extension.test.ts      # Extension unit tests
│   │   ├── http-client.test.ts    # HTTP client tests
│   │   └── integration.test.ts    # E2E tests (template)
│   │
│   ├── bin/
│   │   ├── darwin/
│   │   │   ├── amd64/poml         # macOS Intel
│   │   │   └── arm64/poml         # macOS ARM
│   │   ├── linux/
│   │   │   ├── amd64/poml         # Linux Intel
│   │   │   └── arm64/poml         # Linux ARM
│   │   └── windows/
│   │       ├── amd64/poml.exe     # Windows Intel
│   │       └── arm64/poml.exe     # Windows ARM
│   │
│   ├── .vscode/
│   │   ├── launch.json            # Debug config
│   │   └── tasks.json             # Build tasks
│   │
│   ├── package.json               # Extension manifest + scripts
│   ├── tsconfig.json              # TypeScript config
│   ├── jest.config.js             # Test config
│   ├── .eslintrc.js               # Linting config
│   ├── .prettierrc                # Code formatting
│   ├── .gitignore
│   ├── .vscodeignore
│   └── README.md                  # User documentation
│
├── scripts/
│   └── build-binaries.sh          # NEW: Cross-compile script
│
├── .github/workflows/
│   └── build-release.yml          # NEW: CI/CD pipeline
│
├── docs/
│   ├── vscode-extension.distribution.poml   # NEW: Distribution strategy
│   ├── vscode-extension.quickstart.poml     # NEW: Developer guide
│   └── vscode-extension.e2e-plan.poml       # NEW: Roadmap
│
├── VSCODE_EXTENSION_SUMMARY.md    # NEW: Implementation overview
├── RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md           # NEW: Pre-release checklist
├── DEVELOPER_REFERENCE.md         # NEW: Complete reference
│
└── ... (existing poml-go-sdk files)
