## Quick Command Reference

```bash
# Development
bash scripts/build-binaries.sh        # Build Go binaries
cd vscode-extension && npm install    # Install deps
npm run esbuild-watch                 # Watch TypeScript
code . && F5                          # Debug in VS Code

# Testing
npm test                              # Run all tests
npm test -- --coverage                # Coverage report
npm run lint                          # Check linting

# Production
npm run vscode:prepublish             # Minified build
npm run package                       # Create .vsix

# Publishing
git tag v0.1.0                        # Tag release
git push origin --tags                # Trigger CI/CD
npm run publish                       # Manual publish (if automated fails)
```

---

## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation | Status |
|------|--------|-----------|--------|
| Binary bundling fails | High | Fallback to system PATH | ✅ Handled |
| Port conflicts | Medium | Configurable port in settings | ⏳ Phase 2 |
| Marketplace approval delays | Low | Start with Open VSX (faster) | ✅ Planned |
| Go version mismatch | Low | Lock Go 1.25 in CI | ✅ Done |
| TypeScript compatibility | Low | Strict mode + linting | ✅ Done |
| Platform-specific bugs | Medium | Test on all 6 platforms | ⏳ Phase 2 |

